                <pb facs="0246" n="166" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg166"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15a3/1224: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Garrett</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-11-01T13:00:00+01:00">November 1, 1930—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 1—11:30 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>104. From Gibson. I should like to have your reassurance that the line I have
                    taken with the press agrees with yours.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
